# Capstone 1 – Personal Profile Website

## 📌 Project Overview

This project is a basic personal profile website created as part of my web development learning journey. It focuses on building a webpage using HTML and organizing personal information with a clear, structured layout.

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

- **HTML5** – Used to create the structure and content of the webpage.

## ✨ Features

- Personal profile information
- Headings, paragraphs, and lists
- Basic webpage navigation using hyperlinks
- Organized content using HTML elements

## 🎯 Learning Objectives

- Practice writing HTML from scratch
- Understand the basic structure of an HTML document
- Use HTML elements to organize and display information
- Gain experience creating and linking webpages

## 📂 Project Type

**Beginner Front-End Development | HTML Capstone Project**

## 📚 Project Status

✅ Completed

This project represents an early milestone in my web development journey and demonstrates my foundational understanding of HTML.
